  {
   "id": 632620,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>A bacteria population is 10,000. It triples each day.<br> The bacteria population, <span data-math=\"b\">b</span>, is a function of the number of days, <span data-math=\"d\">d</span>. Which equation relates <span data-math=\"b\">b</span>\n and <span data-math=\"d\">d</span>?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1225104,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"b=10000+3^d\">b=10000+3^d</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1225103,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"b=10000(\\frac13)^d\">b=10000(\\frac13)^d</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1225102,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"b=10000 \\cdot 3d\">b=10000 \\cdot 3d</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1225105,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"b=10000 \\cdot 3^d\">b=10000 \\cdot 3^d</span>"
    }
   ],
   "hints": [],
